flowchart TD
  A([Insert or delete]) --> B[Follow BST ordering]
  B --> C[Modify affected child link]
  C --> D[Return through ancestors]
  D --> E[Recalculate height]
  E --> F[Calculate balance factor]
  F --> G{Outside -1 to +1?}
  G -->|No| H[Keep node]
  G -->|Yes| I[Select LL, RR, LR or RL rotation]
  I --> J[Rotate subtree]
  H --> K([Return new subtree root])
  J --> K
